<div class="fs-1">Help</div>
<br />
<div class=" fs-3">How to Login</div>
<ol>
    <li>
        Go to your email address and find a email from the MMUN email, this email will give you a two numbers: a login and a key (these are used by your whole delegation)
    </li>
    <li>
        Click the "Login" button on the upper right of the site (click the hambager first on mobile) on the navbar
    </li>
    <li>
        Enter the login value provided into the login field (top) and enter the key value into the key field (bottom), then press login
    </li>
</ol>
<br />
<div class=" fs-3">How to create an amendment</div>
<ol>
    <li>
        Navagate to the "Amendments" tab via the navbar
    </li>
    <li>
        Find the resolution you want from the list and click it to expand the menu
    </li>
    <li>
        Click "View as PDF" if you would like to view the resolution
    </li>
    <li>
        Press the green "Create Amendment" button
    </li>
    <li>
        Enter the number of the clause you would like to modify in the "Clause Number" field (this may include letters for sub clauses)
    </li>
    <li>
        Enter your accual change to the clause in the "Details" field
    </li>
</ol>
<br />
<div class=" fs-3">How to debate a resolution</div>
<ol>
    <li>
        Navagate to the "Dashboard" tab via the navbar
    </li>
    <li>
        Press the "Request To Speak" button corasponding to your council
        (GA: General Assembly, ECO: Economic and Social Council, ENV: Enviromental Council, HE: Health Council, SEC: Security Council)
    </li>
    <li>
        You have now request to speak at the microphone, look to the projected SCREEN for when your delegation is in the next 3 to speak, then make your way down to the microphone
    </li>
    <li>
        Wait to be acknowledged by the chair and debate at the microphone
    </li>
</ol>

